  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The velocity of a particle executing SHM varies with displacement (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>) as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. The time period of oscillations is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mn>7</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is ______.</p><p>[Take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>]</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "88",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>50</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>Comparing with standard equation of SHM,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>88</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, required <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>88</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
}